  "description_short": "Relaxed Sedgefield spot serving breakfast, burgers, and craft drinks with a laid-back vibe.",
  "description_long": "Liquid & Leaf brings a relaxed, modern energy to Sedgefield's Main Service Road. The menu covers all-day breakfast favourites, satisfying burgers, and fresh salads, with a good selection of craft beers and specialty coffees to match. The atmosphere is casual and welcoming, making it an easy choice whether you're stopping for a morning cappuccino or settling in for a leisurely lunch.\n\nThe space works well for families, friends catching up, or solo visitors looking for a comfortable place to eat without fuss. Service is friendly and the kitchen delivers consistent, honest food. With its central Sedgefield location, it's a convenient stop for locals and visitors exploring the Garden Route's quieter side.",
